{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Emilie": 53,
    "Player": 35
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7055101",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705510101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705510101": {
            "id": "705510101",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "#Good afternoon, {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510102"
            ]
          },
          "705510102": {
            "id": "705510102",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "...I didn't expect the honor of witnessing your \"harmonizing\" talents here in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510105"
            ]
          },
          "705510105": {
            "id": "705510105",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Both, actually.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510106"
            ]
          },
          "705510106": {
            "id": "705510106",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "A lady calling herself a mage asked me to come manage her flower shop. At about the same time, The Cat's Tail commissioned me to create a new fragrance for their establishment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510107"
            ]
          },
          "705510107": {
            "id": "705510107",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Ending today's busy schedule with a drink crafted by you in person is truly a wonderful reward."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7055103",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705510301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705510301": {
            "id": "705510301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here you go — a new and improved, Emilie-inspired \"Lumidouce Twilight.\" I haven't come up with a name for it yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510302"
            ]
          },
          "705510302": {
            "id": "705510302",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "The colors are cooler and more refreshing, and the fragrance is delightfully subtle to match.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510303"
            ]
          },
          "705510303": {
            "id": "705510303",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Are these bright specks on the surface the crushed petals and leaves of Windwheel Asters?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510306"
            ]
          },
          "705510306": {
            "id": "705510306",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "I'm sure it must taste wonderful... Let me try.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510307"
            ]
          },
          "705510307": {
            "id": "705510307",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Mmm... In the language of flowers, the Windwheel Aster represents \"The Visible Winds.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510308"
            ]
          },
          "705510308": {
            "id": "705510308",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Your cocktail not only captures their form, but also the fragrance they carry.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510309"
            ]
          },
          "705510309": {
            "id": "705510309",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Therefore, I suggest you call this drink \"Windborne Bouquet.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510310"
            ]
          },
          "705510310": {
            "id": "705510310",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "The winds and clouds of Mondstadt swirl together in the glass, leaving behind enchanting traces of fragrance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7055106",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "705510201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "705510201": {
            "id": "705510201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Care to give this a try, Miss Emilie?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510202"
            ]
          },
          "705510202": {
            "id": "705510202",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Your artistry is truly a pleasure to watch...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510203"
            ]
          },
          "705510203": {
            "id": "705510203",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Hmm... This tastes like a local variant of a Lumidouce Twilight. Am I right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510206"
            ]
          },
          "705510206": {
            "id": "705510206",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "The gentle and elegant taste, with its distinct layers, combined with a hint of Mondstadt's characteristic scent, offers quite a welcoming flavor, all the while avoiding potentially discordant aromas...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "705510207"
            ]
          },
          "705510207": {
            "id": "705510207",
            "speakerId": 1090,
            "speakerName": "Emilie",
            "text": "Though in reality, there's no need for you to be so conservative. I have quite a high tolerance for flavors that stray outside the boundaries of conventional wisdom."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}